5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We need a better system. The car is often messy or missing when I need it for my morning routine.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I agree. The constant coordinating and calculating who owes what is becoming a second job. It's exhausting.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is time to move past our improvisations. We must ensure no one is quietly subsidizing another's lifestyle.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I just don't want us fighting. The car is making us grumpy with each other. We need a fix that keeps us friends.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Exactly! But we can't fix it without facts. We've been guessing on fuel and bills for way too long.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I want to know why the midweek mornings are so unreliable. I'll look into the repeating trips and the handover state.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,I'm interested in the time cost. I'll check the diary hours and that month's trial of recording every run.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"To find a fair split, I need the hard numbers. I will examine the tax, insurance, and parking papers, plus fuel receipts.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I want to know what ruins these things. I'll look at what other households said and that spell of checking figures.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'll back that up. I want to see the weeks of heavy use and the mechanic's remarks to see the real wear.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
