25,2,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
26,2,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
27,2,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
28,2,,status,Servas,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
29,2,,status,Takumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
30,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It's worse than I thought. Three of us have weekly clashes, and the car often comes back dirty or empty.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,May,,Recording every run took an hour a week! And the diary shows Saturdays are used way more than Tuesdays.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The fuel is incredibly lopsided; two people paid for most of it. Plus, fixed costs are over 280,000 yen.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Other groups say asking for favors or clinging to turns sours things. Also, checking figures made us feel accused.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"The mechanic says our short city trips are killing the battery. Also, heavy use comes in stressful bursts.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Servas, if the fuel is that uneven, a simple split isn't fair. But @May, an hour of logging sounds miserable.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,May,,"Exactly. We can't spend our free time doing math. We need something that just works without the ""untangling.""","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Servas,,The financial disparity is significant. We cannot ignore that some are paying far more than their fair share.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"But @Servas, if we get too obsessed with the math, we'll end up feeling accused like those other groups did.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"I want the honesty of the figures, but Takumi is right. We can't let the car ruin our friendship.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Misaki,,The handover issue is a dealbreaker for me. I can't start my day cleaning someone else's rubbish.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,May,,"If we have fixed days, we wouldn't have to coordinate every single trip. That would save so much mental energy.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Servas,,"A fixed share might be too simple if the usage remains this lopsided, but it is cleaner.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"We need to avoid the ""favor"" trap. If it's a rule, it's not a favor, and nobody feels resentful.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Kenji,,So we need a balance between precise payment and not spending an hour a week on a spreadsheet.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I just want to know the car will be there and ready on Tuesday morning.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,May,,I'm leaning toward anything that stops the constant texting and negotiating.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Servas,,We must decide if we value absolute mathematical equity or social harmony more.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Takumi,,Harmony first. I'd rather pay a bit more than have us stop talking to each other.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I agree. Let's look at the options and pick the one that's ""fair enough"" without being a chore.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
