55,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A gives me my guaranteed mornings. No more wondering where the car is or who has it.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,May,,Option A also kills the coordination time. No more arranging every single run. It's a huge relief.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option C is the most equitable for costs, but @May already said the recording is too time-consuming.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"Option C sounds like the ""checking figures"" nightmare. I vote against anything that requires constant auditing.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Option B puts the burden on one person. That might lead to the ""favor"" resentment Takumi mentioned.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Servas, would Option A be too unfair? We'd all pay a fixed share regardless of distance.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,May,,"It's the only one that stops the ""untangling"" of debts. I'm voting for A.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Servas,,"It is not perfectly equitable, but it removes the friction of checking receipts, which we know is toxic.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"I like A. It's a clear rule. No favors, no accusations, just ""it's my day.""","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"If we go with A, we just need to agree on a basic cleanliness rule for the handovers.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm happy with A. It solves my reliability problem and the scheduling clashes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Servas,,I can accept A. Peace of mind is worth a slight imbalance in fuel costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll vote A too. It's the best compromise between my need for a system and Takumi's need for peace.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
